<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<Defs>
  <ThingDef ParentName="SZBeastParent">
    <defName>SZ_SeXie</defName>
    <label>sexie (human form)</label>
    <description>Tip: a colony with a Pleiades star officer in it has a far easier time against a sexie. \n\nIn Shenzhou legend the sexie has a better known name: the heart-butchering scorpion. When the Tianbing mechanoid clan's gene engineers designed it they distilled a scorpion's venom into its genes and gave it a human shape as well, which is why the sexie is reckoned the most complicated and changeable of the beasts they made. \n\nSexies often attack the small trading posts the Shenzhou settlements keep on the rim - few permanent residents, but sitting on important routes. Surviving ship traders say the sexie has two shapes, human and scorpion, and that neither is easy to deal with. \n\nThe human shape will not attack colonists of its own accord, but every so often it sends out a hallucinatory sound that splits the head, driving the most psychically sensitive colonist berserk against their own companions. \n\nIn a fight it stabs with a three-pronged fork, and the horse-felling venom on it drops a colonist to the ground in pain.</description>
    <statBases>
      <MoveSpeed>5.5</MoveSpeed>
      <ArmorRating_Sharp>0.55</ArmorRating_Sharp>
      <ArmorRating_Blunt>0.35</ArmorRating_Blunt>
      <MeleeDodgeChance>0.5</MeleeDodgeChance>
    </statBases>
    <race>
      <thinkTreeMain>SZ_AISeXie</thinkTreeMain>
      <body>SZ_Human_SeXie</body>
      <baseHealthScale>20</baseHealthScale>
    </race>
    <damageMultipliers>
      <li>
        <damageDef>AntiEvilBeastBullet</damageDef>
        <multiplier>6</multiplier>
      </li>
    </damageMultipliers>
    <tools>
      <li>
        <label>bite</label>
        <capacities>
          <li>SZ_SeXieToxicBite</li>
        </capacities>
        <power>25</power>
        <armorPenetration>1</armorPenetration>
        <cooldownTime>1</cooldownTime>
        <linkedBodyPartsGroup>SZ_TailAttackTool</linkedBodyPartsGroup>
      </li>
    </tools>
    <comps>
      <li>
        <compClass>AncientChineseBeast.CompActiveAfterTakenDamage</compClass>
      </li>
      <li Class="AncientChineseBeast.CompProperties_ConnaturalAbilities">
        <abilities>
          <li>SZ_SeXieShootA</li>
        </abilities>
      </li>
      <li>
        <compClass>AncientChineseBeast.CompSeXieExpansion</compClass>
      </li>
    </comps>
  </ThingDef>
  <PawnKindDef ParentName="SZBeast_PawnKindParent">
    <defName>SZ_SeXie</defName>
    <race>SZ_SeXie</race>
    <label>sexie (human form)</label>
    <combatPower>1200</combatPower>
    <ecoSystemWeight>0.01</ecoSystemWeight>
    <lifeStages>
      <li>
        <bodyGraphicData>
          <texPath>AncientChineseBeast/SeXie/Human</texPath>
          <drawSize>1.5</drawSize>
        </bodyGraphicData>
        <dessicatedBodyGraphicData>
          <texPath>AncientChineseBeast/SeXie/Human</texPath>
          <drawSize>1.5</drawSize>
        </dessicatedBodyGraphicData>
      </li>
    </lifeStages>
  </PawnKindDef>

  <ThingDef ParentName="BaseProjectileNeolithic">
    <defName>SZ_SeXiePoisonousThorn</defName>
    <label>sting</label>
    <graphicData>
      <texPath>AncientChineseBeast/SeXie/Thorn</texPath>
